{"last_link_id": 51, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": false}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "【Supermate】HeartMula 自动刷歌工作流V2", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [3025, 250], "pos": [-1683.97900390625, -534.4266967773438], "id": 16, "properties": {"padding": 50, "backgroundColor": "#fa8c35", "fontFamily": "黑体", "borderRadius": 300, "textAlign": "left", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "angle": 0, "fontSize": 150, "fontColor": "#ffffff"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["1. max_audio_length_ms\n含义：最大音频长度，单位是毫秒（ms）\n作用：设置输入音频的最长允许时长。这里设为 240000，也就是240 秒（4 分钟）。\n超过这个时长的音频会被自动截断，确保模型处理的音频长度在设计范围内，避免内存溢出或性能问题。\n2. topk\n含义：Top-K 采样\n作用：生成时只从概率最高的前 K 个候选词中随机选择。这里设为 50。\n值越大，生成结果越丰富但可能发散；值越小，结果越聚焦但可能单调。\n它常用于文本生成、语音合成或音乐生成类模型，平衡多样性与连贯性。\n3. temperature\n含义：温度系数\n作用：控制生成结果的随机性。这里设为 1.0，是中性值。\n温度越高（>1），生成越随机、创意性越强；温度越低（<1），生成越保守、越倾向于高概率内容。\n1.0 表示完全按照模型预测的概率分布进行采样，不做额外调整。\n4. cfg_scale (Classifier-Free Guidance Scale)\n含义：无分类器引导系数\n作用：控制提示词（Prompt）对生成结果的影响强度。这里设为 1.5。\n值越高，生成结果越严格遵循提示词；值越低，生成结果更自由、受提示词约束更小。\n常见范围在 1~10 之间，1.5 属于较低的引导强度，适合希望保留一定生成自由度的场景。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [370.2872619628906, 274.8255920410156], "pos": [-1837.1148681640625, -41.12104797363281], "id": 6, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [32], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [350, 450], "pos": [-488.9530334472656, -21.565038681030273], "widgets_values": ["[Verse 1]  \n闹钟没响我赖床到日头西斜  \n咖啡杯边沿还留着昨夜的糖渍  \n手机弹出新消息但全都不急  \n周末的节奏，慢得像在等奇迹  \n\n[Prechorus]  \n计划表撕了三张，说好去海边  \n结果在沙发啃薯片，追完三部剧  \n朋友发来定位，我回了个“在梦里”  \n生活没崩，只是节奏太随意  \n\n[Chorus]  \n周末是自由的假面舞会  \n不打卡、不汇报、不排队  \n睡到自然醒，吃撑不减肥  \n世界暂停键，只为你我放肆  \n\n[Verse 2]  \n衣柜里新衣没穿，堆成小山丘  \n购物车清空又满，像在打游戏  \n刷完短视频再刷直播，停不下来  \n周末的快乐，藏在滑动的指尖  \n\n[Prechorus]  \n想约人喝咖啡，却先约了自己  \n想写诗想旅行，先瘫在被窝里  \n朋友说“你该出门”，我笑说“等明天”  \n明天总在等，等得连阳光都倦了  \n\n[Chorus]  \n周末是自由的假面舞会  \n不打卡、不汇报、不排队  \n睡到自然醒，吃撑不减肥  \n世界暂停键，只为你我放肆  \n\n[Bridge]  \n别问为什么，别管有没有意义  \n周末就是用来不被定义  \n就算沙发塌了，咖啡凉了  \n我也要笑出声，不问明天几时  \n\n[Chorus]  \n周末是自由的假面舞会  \n不打卡、不汇报、不排队  \n睡到自然醒，吃撑不减肥  \n世界暂停键，只为你我放肆  \n\n[Outro]  \n…周末…  \n…自由…  \n…不赶路…  \n…不着急…"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 42, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [34], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [240, 170], "pos": [-480.2568664550781, 491.5433654785156], "widgets_values": ["indie pop, analog synth, drum machine, warm electric guitar, mid-tempo, breathy female vocals, cinematic, lo-fi"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 43, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [40, 42], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 402], "pos": [-1348.5997314453125, 42.67457962036133], "widgets_values": ["创作一首完整的原创歌曲歌词，语言根据用户需求使用中文或英文。\n整首歌词时长对应约4分钟以内（通常3–4段主歌+副歌循环）。\n\n结构必须包含以下标签段落：\n[Verse]、[Prechorus]、[Chorus]、[Bridge]、[Outro]\n\n内容要求：\n\n主题围绕“承诺未兑现”展开，可聚焦科技行业、开源社区、企业宣传与实际行动的落差；\n情绪递进：从观察描述 → 质疑 → 失望/觉醒 → 反思或留白；\n使用具体、可感知的意象（如“PPT还在改”“密钥从未公开”“开发者默默离开”“发布会日期成谜”），避免抽象口号；\n语言自然流畅，符合目标语言（中/英）的口语表达习惯，便于演唱；\n中文歌词需押韵合理，英文歌词需注意音节节奏与重音分布；\n[Chorus] 需具备重复性和核心观点提炼；[Outro] 应简短、有余韵，不引入新信息；\n不得包含与主题无关的抒情、爱情、自然风景等偏离内容。\n仅输出歌词文本，不附加说明、注释或格式外内容。", "写一首主题《周末》轻松歌谣，年轻女性演唱。不要输出think", "Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 1475, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, "name": "text2", "label": "text2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text2"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_pixels"}, "name": "min_pixels", "label": "min_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "min_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_pixels"}, "name": "max_pixels", "label": "max_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention"}, "name": "attention", "label": "attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention"}], "flags": {}, "id": 28, "type": "Qwen3_VQA_Plus", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Qwen3_VQA_Plus"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [43], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 402], "pos": [-922.448486328125, 284.09149169921875], "widgets_values": ["你是一位音乐制作专家，擅长根据歌词主题与情绪，精准指定音乐风格、核心乐器、节奏特征和人声类型。\n仅输出一行英文关键词组合，用逗号分隔，包含以下要素：\n\n主流音乐风格（如 synth-pop, alternative rock, R&B, electronic, indie folk 等）\n2–4 种关键乐器或音色（如 drum machine, analog synth, electric guitar, orchestral strings 等）\n节奏或动态特征（如 mid-tempo, driving beat, sparse arrangement, pulsing rhythm 等）\n人声描述（如 clean female voice, gritty male vocal, breathy delivery, powerful belting 等）\n可选：整体氛围或制作质感（如 cinematic, lo-fi, polished, dystopian, warm analog 等）\n禁止输出中文、解释、段落或换行。仅返回一行逗号分隔的英文关键词。", "输入歌词", "Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 1927, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, "name": "text2", "link": 40, "label": "text2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text2"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_pixels"}, "name": "min_pixels", "label": "min_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "min_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_pixels"}, "name": "max_pixels", "label": "max_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention"}, "name": "attention", "label": "attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention"}], "flags": {}, "id": 29, "type": "Qwen3_VQA_Plus", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Qwen3_VQA_Plus"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["原版歌词\n\n[Verse]\n克莱因不开你不开\n承诺像风中的尘埃\n狼要来了挂嘴边\n日子一天天空等待\n社区敲着键盘盼\n竞品早已亮底牌\n发布会的PPT还在改\n开源日期成谜猜\n\n[Prechorus]\n行业车轮转得快\n你在原地打节拍\n热度被别人抢光才无奈\n\n[Chorus]\n承诺说了又更改\n开源之路慢慢捱\n别人亮剑你徘徊\n商业利益摆前排\n这场拖延戏码看得人倦怠\n\n[Verse]\n\n参数吹得有多帅\n闭源的门就关多快\n竞品开源即巅峰\n你还在把借口掰\n开发者们纷纷离开\n信任碎成了石块\n所谓突破藏着掖着\n不过是自我澎湃\n\n[Bridge]\n\n别说社区是阻碍\n不过是利益在摇摆\n开源旗号喊得慷慨\n行动却慢得奇怪\n\n[Chorus]\n承诺说了又更改\n开源之路慢慢捱\n别人亮剑你徘徊\n商业利益摆前排\n\n[Outro]\n还在等花开\n遥遥无期的未来\n\n原版风格\nR&B, drum machine, powerful, epic, Keyboard, electronic，clean female voice\n\n\n歌词部分接入lyrics@HeartMuLa Music Generator\n风格部分接入lyricstags@HeartMuLa Music Generator\n\n\n\n\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [390, 370], "pos": [-1857.11328125, 284.3110656738281], "id": 11, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [], "size": [423.38555908203125, 209.80332946777344], "pos": [364.91485595703125, 140.62489318847656], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "l